From 90f2f2db320c1ba70c84c8e496d2942511f0d332 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bb-machine <ubuntu@bb-machine>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:39:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(admission): retain cancelled historical revision identity

Allocate explicit new historical edits after all retained accepted revisions without reviving cancelled operations. Fence competing revisions in the acceptance transaction and reconcile a same-operation lookup race through its frozen revision and existing authored binding.
